auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # StampCard API (Node backend)

  Covers all endpoints of Stampcard.Backend.node.

  ## Setup
  1. Select the environment `Local` and fill in the secret variables
     (client secret and passwords) and the usernames of an admin, a coach and an accounting user.
  2. `coachEmail` must be the email claim of the coach user, otherwise the coach cannot see the test team.
  3. Run the collection with the runner: the folders are numbered and build on each other.
     The `Login as ...` requests store the token in `accessToken`, ids are passed on as runtime variables.

  The test team `{{teamName}}` is deleted again in `12 Cleanup`.
}
